# Atlas Getting Started Demo
# Shows the core workflow in ~30 seconds

Output getting-started.gif

# Settings
Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1000
Set Height 600
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

# Title
Type "# Atlas - ADHD-Friendly Project Tracker"
Enter
Sleep 1s

# Check where we left off
Type "atlas where"
Enter
Sleep 2s

# Start a session
Type "atlas session start atlas 'Working on documentation'"
Enter
Sleep 2s

# Capture an idea without losing focus
Type "atlas catch 'add dark mode to dashboard'"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s

# Check session status
Type "atlas session status"
Enter
Sleep 2s

# End session
Type "atlas session end 'Created demo GIFs'"
Enter
Sleep 2.5s

# Show stats
Type "atlas stats"
Enter
Sleep 3s
